DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Function ddwwaarrff__eexxppaanndd__ffrraammee__iinnssttrruuccttiioonnss() translates DWARF frame in‐
     struction bytes into an array of _D_w_a_r_f___F_r_a_m_e___O_p descriptors.

     Argument _c_i_e should reference the CIE descriptor associated with the in‐
